        <headline>Tropical Storm Watch issued September 24 at 11:29AM HST by NWS Honolulu HI</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...For the Small Craft Advisory, east winds to 25 kt and
seas 7 to 10 feet. For the Tropical Storm Watch, east winds 25
to 35 kt and seas 9 to 14 feet.

* WHERE...Kaiwi Channel, Maui County Windward Waters and Maui
County Leeward Waters.

* WHEN...For the Small Craft Advisory, until 6 AM HST Friday. For
the Tropical Storm Watch, beginning at 6 AM HST Friday.

* IMPACTS...Very strong winds will cause hazardous seas which
could capsize or damage vessels and reduce visibility.
</description>
        <instruction>Mariners should consider altering plans to avoid possible
hazardous conditions. Remain in port, seek safe harbor, alter
course, and/or secure the vessel for severe wind and seas.</instruction>
